      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Listen, I get it – you're tired and worried about the cost and the drive, but your chest feeling heavy is not something to take lightly. It could be a sign of something more serious, like a heart problem. Magnesium can help with heart rhythm, but it can also cause problems if it's not balanced with other electrolytes. I can't stress enough how important it is to get checked out by a professional. Your health is too valuable to gamble with. Let's find a way to make it easier for you to get the care you need.",
